meta {
  name: 05_ResourceFilter
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Scenario: Narrowing the party list with anyOfResourceIds

    Given the unfiltered list contains the parties the scenario is about
    When the list is filtered on a resource delegated to the caller on one client
    Then that client is returned with the resource, and a client without it is not
    When the list is filtered on a resource delegated only to a subunit
    Then the subunit carries the resource and its main unit is a hierarchy element only
    When the list is filtered on a resource id that does not exist
    Then the party list is empty
}
